            0.057
          ],
          "content": "国家自然科学基金资助项目结题/成果报告"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.07,
            0.211,
            0.089
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "项目摘要"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.093,
            0.199,
            0.11
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "中文摘要:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.111,
            0.888,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": "近年来，国际贸易紧张局势和贸易政策不确定性再度升级，新冠病毒肺炎疫情大爆发，全球经济衰退风险加剧，显著地增加了系统性金融风险发生的可能性，防范系统性金融风险成为金融监管工作的重中之重。然而，现有的系统性金融风险度量存在不能及时反映风险波动等问题。本项目依据金融学原理，发展系统性风险度量理论，给出管理系统性金融风险的最优策略；运用数学统计，大数据和人工智能手段，充分挖掘和提炼目前能够获取的两类包含系统性风险数据，从在海外交易的中国公司的信用违约互换数据中提取出系统性风险信息，再使用文本分析方法从中文报纸新闻数据抽取蕴含在新闻数据中的系统性风险信息；最后使用抽取出的信息构建及时准确的中国系统性金融风险波动指数。这些研究从我国经济发展所面临的重大实际问题中提炼出新的科学问题，在理论上属于前沿，具有突出的原创性，具有重要的学术价值；在应用上对于防控中国系统性金融风险具有显著的实际价值。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.371,
            0.2,
            0.388
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Abstract:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.388,
            0.88,
            0.681
          ],
          "content": "In recent years, the heightening of international trade tensions and policyuncertainty, and the outbreak of the coronavirus disease have put the global economy at the risk of recession. This significantly increases the financial systemic risk. Therefore, detecting and controlling the financial systemic risk becomes the top priority of financial regulations. However, existing measures of financial systemic risk may not reflect systemic risk in time. This project applies principles of Finance, develops the theory of measuring systemic risk, provides the optimal policy for systemic risk management, employs mathematics modeling, statistics, big data and artificial intelligence, extracts information from two types of daily firm-level data, first extracts information on systemic risk from trading data of Chinese firms in the oversea credit default swap market, then applies textual analysis to extract information on systemic risk from Chinese newspapers, and finally uses the extracted information to build timely and accurate measures of financial systemic risk in China. This research finds new scientific problems from urgent problems of the economic development in our country. This research is novel and has high values in both academic research and applications, as it solves real urgent problems for financial regulators to detect and control financial systemic risk in China."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.826,
            0.804,
            0.869
          ],
          "content": "关键词（用分号分开）:风险度量；信用违约互换；数据挖掘；报纸新闻；文本分析"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.88,
            0.809,
            0.921
          ],
          "content": "Keywords (separated by;): systemic risk; credit default swap; data mining; newspaper; textual analysis"
        },
        {
