          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "结题摘要"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.1,
            0.092,
            0.879,
            0.127
          ],
          "content": "中文摘要（对项目的背景、主要研究内容、重要结果、关键数据及其科学意义等做简单概述）:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.128,
            0.889,
            0.181
          ],
          "content": "项目背景:在全球经济下行风险不容忽视及新冠疫情冲击的背景下，防范化解系统性金融风险成为国家重大需求。现有度量指标普遍依赖季度更新的财务数据，存在时效性差、难以精准反映风险波动等技术瓶颈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.196,
            0.771,
            0.215
          ],
          "content": "主要研究内容:项目基于金融学、大数据及人工智能手段，重点开展以下研究:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.231,
            0.878,
            0.265
          ],
          "content": "1. 数据挖掘与处理:利用在海外交易的中国公司信用违约互换（CDS）交易数据，提取与信用直接相关的风险信息"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.266,
            0.886,
            0.299
          ],
          "content": "2. 文本分析:运用文本分析方法，从超过20份中文报纸、30万条新闻中抽取蕴含在报道中的非信用直接相关风险信息"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.299,
            0.886,
            0.335
          ],
          "content": "3. 指数构建:融合两类数据信息，构建能够及时、精准反映中国系统性金融风险波动的综合指数。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.351,
            0.312,
            0.367
          ],
          "content": "重要结果与关键数据:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.368,
            0.886,
            0.402
          ],
          "content": "1. 关键数据源:选定近百家关系国民经济命脉的超大型国有上市公司（如中国移动、中国银行等）的美元债务CDS作为标的，结合覆盖社会经济各方面的日频新闻数据"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.402,
            0.886,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": "2. 核心成果:构建了一套新型的系统性金融风险监测指标体系，并在国际高水平学术期刊发表7篇论文篇 。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.453,
            0.224,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": "科学意义:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.471,
            0.886,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": "1. 理论层面:发展了基于公司层面多源数据的系统性风险度量理论，推动金融基础研究成果的原创性突破。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.505,
            0.887,
            0.54
          ],
          "content": "2. 应用层面:为金融监管部门提供量化参考，有助于健全及时反映风险波动的信息系统，对维护国家金融安全具有显著的实际价值"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.548,
            0.762,
            0.583
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Abstract (Brief description of research background, main methods, contributions, and research data):"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.584,
            0.879,
            0.671
          ],
          "content": "Project Background: Against the backdrop of global economic downturn risks that cannot be overlooked and the impact of the COVID-19 pandemic, preventing and mitigating systemic financial risks has become a major national priority. Existing measurement indicators generally rely on quarterly financial data, presenting technical bottlenecks such as poor timeliness and difficulty in accurately reflecting risk fluctuations."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.686,
            0.844,
            0.721
          ],
          "content": "Main Research Content: The project focuses on the following research areas based on finance, big data, and artificial intelligence:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.737,
            0.886,
            0.822
          ],
          "content": "1. Data Mining and Processing: Utilize credit default swap (CDS) trading data of Chinese companies operating overseas to extract risk information directly related to credit. 2. Text Analysis: Utilizing text analysis methods, extract non-credit directly related risk information embedded in reports from over 20 Chinese newspapers and 0.3 million news articles."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.823,
            0.837,
            0.875
          ],
          "content": "3. Index Construction: Integrate information from two types of data to construct a comprehensive index capable of promptly and accurately reflecting fluctuations in China's systemic financial risks."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.891,
            0.384,
            0.908
          ],
          "content": "Key Outcomes and Critical Data:"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.476,
            0.936,
            0.525,
            0.95
          ],
          "content": "第2页"
        }
      ]
    },
