          ],
          "content": "```\n1. Key Data Sources: Selected dollar-denominated debt CDS of over a hundred large\nstate-owned listed companies critical to the national economy (such as China Mobile and\nBank of China) as benchmarks, combined with daily news data covering various aspects of\nsocio-economy.\n2. Core Achievements: A new systematic financial risk monitoring indicator system was\nestablished, with multiple papers published in high-impact international academic\n journals.\nScientific Significance:\n1. Theoretical Aspect: Developed a systematic risk measurement theory based on\nmulti-source corporate-level data, driving original breakthroughs in foundationa\nfinancial research.\n2. Application Level: It provides quantitative references for financial regulatory\nauthorities, contributing to the improvement of information systems that promptly\nreflect risk fluctuations, which holds significant practical value in safeguarding\nnational financial security.\n关键词（用分号分开）：系统性金融风险；风险度量                                   文本分析；大数据；\n 信用违约互换\nKeywords (separated by;): systemic financial        risk; risk measurement;\ntextual analysis; big data; credit default         swap\n```",
